  "Access rows (22): the four constraint fields are the literal texts quoted in the paragraph, metac equals accconst and metuc equals useconst, and the record carries no new licence; the modern creator is the literal legacy credit typed organisational, except 288 (two people with the \"of\" affiliation), 1864 (the institute without the role clause), 4027 (two organisations and three people, as the creator426 note reads), 4063 (two organisations) and 1994 (the Exxon821 projection). Hold any of these five the record does not settle.",
  "Creator rows (9 admitted, 2817 held): the names, order and entity type are Brett's answers; the context note and paragraph quote the origin text or say it is empty, name the contact as a separate role and name the evidence the sheet gave.",
  "Date rows (5): the correction manifest binds the exact source value (\"2080207\" or blank) and the corrected day; the paragraph gives the source value, the corrected value, the reason and the decision; the publication date of the v1 wire is the corrected day.",
